{
"version": "1",
"text": "This look balances the office day with your creative space: the black blazer sets a neat tone, the ribbed turtleneck brings soft texture under it, and the graphite jeans ground the whole thing in relaxed ease. The burgundy loafers add warmth and polish without being formal, while the red salon bag introduces an elegant accent that echoes the shoes. It works by leading your eye vertically along the long lines of the blazer and jeans, keeping the middle quiet so you can feel comfortable with confidence.",
"how_to_wear": "Tuck the ribbed turtleneck into the wide legs to define a clean line without marking the waist.",
