"about_items": [
{
"n": "#96·32",
"text": "The black blazer is structured and tailored, with signature button details along the front and cuffs that give it polish. Its short cut keeps the silhouette clean and modern while allowing easy movement through your office hours."
},
{
"n": "#14·06",
"text": "The ribbed turtleneck sweater sits snug against your figure with a soft, stretchy knit that follows your curves. It has a high neck with small buttons down the placket, adding a subtle detail without overwhelming the look."
},
{
"n": "#164·06",
"text": "The graphite boyfriend jeans offer a relaxed fit and wide leg silhouette in a muted dark shade. Their straight cut drapes effortlessly over your legs, providing comfort for a full day of work and easy transition to creative meetings."
},
{
"n": "#27·15",
"text": "The burgundy loafers feature a smooth, glossy finish with a classic penny strap and low block heel. They bring warmth and sophistication while remaining understated enough for your office environment."
},
{
"n": "#382·07",
"text": "The red salon bag has a sleek, rectangular shape in rich patent leather with an elegant turn-lock clasp. Its minimalist design and vibrant color make it the perfect finishing touch that ties together the monochrome base of your outfit."
}
]
}
